#: {{ux|en|a '''knotty''' pine}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Tempest|act=I|scene=ii|page=|column=|passage=If thou murmur'st, I will rend an oak / And peg thee in his '''knotty''' entrails till / Thou hast howl'd away twelve winters.}}
